  "question": {
    "text": "An elemental crystal has a density of <math><mn>8570</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></math>. The packing efficiency is 0.68. The closest distance of approach between neighbouring atom is <math><mn>2.86</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Å</mi></math>. What is the mass in amu of one atom approximately?<br />\r[Report your answer by rounding it upto nearset whole number]",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "93",
  "solution": {
    "text": "The <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.68</mn></math>, means the given lattice is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>.<br /><br />The closest distance of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mn>2</mn><mtext>r</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>2.86</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mover> <mtext>A</mtext> <mi>o</mi> </mover> <mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> <mtext>a</mtext> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> <mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2.86</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mn>3.30</mn><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mover> <mtext>A</mtext> <mi>o</mi> </mover> </mrow> </math> .<br /><br />Let, at. wt. of the <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>= w</mo></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×w</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>23</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3.3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>–</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>8570</mn></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow>  <mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>92.39</mn><mtext>&#x00A0;</mtext><mo>&#x2243;</mo><mo>&#x00A0;</mo><mn>93</mn></mrow></math> amu",
